        <summary>State indicating process startup has made it to first frame draw.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>State indicating process startup has made it to first frame draw. Startup information in ApplicationStartInfo is complete with potential exception of fully drawn timestamp which is not guaranteed to be set.</para>
